        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Importance of Ocean Conservation: Understanding the Threats and Solutions</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #0d1117;\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 816px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #101418;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- HEADER ---------- */\n  .hero {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 372px;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1d7f7a 0%, #17706f 35%, #0e5b60 70%, #0a4a52 100%);\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 0 50px;\n  }\n  .hero .water-photo {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.10) 0 12%, transparent 40%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 0 15%, transparent 45%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 15%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0 20%, transparent 50%);\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.45);\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .boat-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 130px;\n    right: 130px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 130px;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 4;\n    padding-top: 45px;\n  }\n  .logo .l1 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .logo .l2 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .logo .l3 {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #17706f;\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1.1px;\n    padding: 3px 5px;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n  }\n  .hero-sub {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 4;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    margin-top: 55px;\n  }\n  .hero-title {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 4;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1.28;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n  .hero-title .indent { padding-left: 12px; display: block; }\n  .hero-desc {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 4;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    max-width: 545px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- BODY GRID ---------- */\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n    padding: 30px 50px 0 50px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 472px; }\n  .col-right { width: 222px; }\n\n  h2.sec {\n    color: #35c4a8;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- CHART ---------- */\n  .chart-title {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 32px 0 14px 10px;\n  }\n  .chart-placeholder {\n    width: 460px;\n    height: 205px;\n    margin-left: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- AUTHOR ---------- */\n  .author {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  .avatar-placeholder {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    flex: 0 0 62px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n  .author-info .name {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .author-info .line {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #e6ebee;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    margin: 22px 0 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- NUMBERED CARDS ---------- */\n  .cards {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 27px;\n    padding: 22px 50px 0 50px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 222px;\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    color: #222;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding: 28px 16px 20px 26px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -12px;\n    left: -12px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #35c4a8;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- FOOTER AREA ---------- */\n  .bottom {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 30px;\n    padding: 28px 50px 0 50px;\n  }\n  .refs { width: 345px; }\n  .refs hr {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n    margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n    width: 345px;\n  }\n  .refs .lbl {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .refs ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .refs li {\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .concl { width: 350px; padding-top: 4px; }\n  .concl h2 { margin-bottom: 10px; }\n\n  .footer-bar {\n    height: 34px;\n    background: #17706f;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"water-photo\"></div>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder boat-placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Photo: aerial ocean water with small white boat, top-right]</figure>\n\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"l1\">XAVIER'S</div>\n      <div class=\"l2\">SCHOOL</div>\n      <div class=\"l3\">OF GIFTED YOUNGSTERS</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-sub\">The Importance of Ocean Conservation:</div>\n    <div class=\"hero-title\">\n      Understanding\n      <span class=\"indent\">the Threats and Solutions</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-desc\">\n      The ocean is a vital resource that supports life on Earth, yet it faces a growing number\n      of threats from human activities. This poster provides an overview of the importance of\n      ocean conservation and highlights the key threats facing the world's oceans.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== MAIN CONTENT ===== -->\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">Background</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">\n        The world's oceans cover more than 70% of the Earth's surface and support a diverse\n        range of ecosystems, including coral reefs, kelp forests, and open ocean habitats.\n        However, the ocean is facing a growing number of threats, including climate change,\n        overfishing, and plastic pollution. These threats can have far-reaching impacts on both\n        marine and human life.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"chart-title\">Global Ocean Heat</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n        [Chart: area/line graph \"Global Ocean Heat\", left column. Y-axis: 30, 20, 10, 0, -10, -20. X-axis: 1960, 1970, 1980, 1990, 2000, 2010, 2020]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">Methodology</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">\n        This poster presents a review of the\n        latest research on the threats facing the\n        world's oceans and the solutions being\n        proposed to address them. The research\n        draws on a range of academic sources,\n        including peer-reviewed journal articles\n        and reports from international\n        organizations.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"author\">\n        <figure class=\"placeholder avatar-placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Photo: portrait]</figure>\n        <div class=\"author-info\">\n          <div class=\"name\">Louie Gardner</div>\n          <div class=\"line\">Affiliation: University of ABC</div>\n          <div class=\"line\">E: name@universityname.edu</div>\n          <div class=\"line\">P: 413-748-3004</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">Results</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">\n        The research shows that the threats\n        facing the world's oceans are complex\n        and interrelated, requiring a range of\n        solutions to address them. Key findings\n        include:\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== CARDS ===== -->\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">1</div>\n      Climate change is causing ocean temperatures to rise, leading to coral bleaching and other impacts on marine life.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">2</div>\n      Overfishing is depleting fish populations, leading to ecological imbalances and economic losses for coastal communities.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"badge\">3</div>\n      Plastic pollution is a growing threat to marine life, with millions of tons of plastic waste entering the ocean each year.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== BOTTOM ===== -->\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n    <div class=\"refs\">\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"lbl\">References:</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC). (2019). Special Report on the Ocean and Cryosphere in a Changing Climate.</li>\n        <li>United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP). (2016). Marine Litter and Microplastics: Global Lessons and Research to Inspire Action &amp; Guide Policy Change.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"concl\">\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">Conclusions</h2>\n      <p class=\"body\">\n        This poster demonstrates the urgent need to address threats to\n        the world's oceans. Among the potential solutions are\n        greenhouse gas reductions, sustainable fishing practices, and\n        better waste management and recycling. Protecting our oceans\n        will ensure that life on Earth continues for generations to come.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-bar\"></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
